OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions over effectiveness of
OL,4,Anew Respect Orders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man responsible for overseeing West
OL,7,FMercia Police has cast doubt on the
OL,8,Feffectiveness of new Respect Orders.
OL,10,FThey were introduced by the Labour
OL,11,Fgovernment on Monday and partly replace
OL,12,Fthe older Anti-social Behaviour Order
OL,13,F(Asbo).
OL,15,FBut John Campion, the Conservative
OL,16,FPolice and Crime Commissioner (PCC) for
OL,17,FWest Mercia Police, said they would be
OL,18,Fa "toothless tiger" without strong
OL,19,Fdeterrents to back them up.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
