OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions over effectiveness of
OL,4,Anew Respect Orders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said the Respect Orders
OL,7,Fgive the police and local authorities a
OL,8,Fwider range of punishments to address
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour, enabling them to
OL,10,F"take stronger enforcement action
OL,11,Fagainst relentless adult offenders...".
